* When parsing, change the XNode tree to be a flat array
    This will allow us to create a `Defered` tag that only needs to store an index into the array to know where to continue from
    The XNode will need to know when to branch and unbranch

* Create observable values
    When a node uses {} that node needs to be notified when the value changes
    The node observing the value needs:
        1. An Observer component with the id of the value being observed
    When something wants to allow a value to be observed it needs to create
        1. Create a new Entity with an Observed compenent with the id of the value being observed and it's new value

* Resouce for tracking id'd nodes